  (text "雷达 TX 接到 GPIO18，雷达 RX 接到 GPIO17（交叉）" (at 168 228 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid b6ad6d63-48db-400c-b518-1bba9c954ab9)
  )
  (text "EN 接到 VIN，开关打开模块就工作" (at 96 154 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 28710a54-4797-40a1-a3f5-af733fe7aa8e)
  )
  (rectangle (start 12 28) (end 250 118)
    (stroke (width 0.35) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid 6536d80e-89ab-4c91-9bfd-3ff6de69f5c6)
  )
  (text "接线时读这里" (at 16 112 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 3.0 3.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 9e5b88d9-df0f-45a4-bfd1-846e4f5875e8)
  )
  (text "1  同名标号是同一根线。GND：电池负极、升压地、雷达地、H2 脚2、J1 脚2。" (at 16 105 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left))
    (uuid bc676a8b-bdfd-4029-8a20-25c1a7ffb9b8)
  )
  (text "    VBAT：电池正极和 J1 脚1。中间没有画成长线，是为了不和别的线叠在一起。" (at 16 100 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left))
    (uuid b8abaad2-8416-40ef-be32-33abd9c3af3f)
  )
  (text "2  雷达串口用 H2 脚7 GPIO17（板子发送）和脚8 GPIO18（板子接收）。3.3V，串联 220 欧。" (at 16 94.5 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left))
    (uuid 982efbcf-f22c-4306-815b-304bd45497c6)
  )
  (text "    不要用脚4 / 脚5 的 UART0，也不要把 5V 碰到任何 GPIO。PA9 本版不接。" (at 16 89.5 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left))
    (uuid 2710c7b3-315a-4fe6-bbe6-efb9d7e18cda)
  )
  (text "3  5V 从电池正极 VBAT1 升压得到。不要用排针上的 3V3，也不要靠 VBUS（只有插着 USB 才有）。" (at 16 84 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left))
    (uuid 1db071a0-18de-496d-a852-7066c5016b21)
  )
  (text "    AXP2101 的 VSYS（34 脚）没有引到排针或电池座。" (at 16 79 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left))
    (uuid 65ad5499-14cf-4e9c-b11a-06ec6f467cbe)
  )
  (text "4  开关只切断升压模块。电池仍然进 J1，USB 才能充电。充电时把开关关掉。" (at 16 73.5 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left))
    (uuid 502a7c04-c35b-4516-a4f6-e97ef8d2d3f7)
  )
  (text "5  H2 脚序按 Waveshare 原理图 PDF（2025-07-28）：1 VBUS，2 GND，3 VCC3V3，" (at 16 68 0)
    (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left))
    (uuid 24746ac8-7fea-4c6c-b507-2576f779cb84)
  )
